        "ImageDescription": {
          "value": "An example of ball rolling by a bumble bee, <i>Bombus terrestris</i>, at speed \u00d70.5. The bee approaches a wooden coloured ball while facing it, touches the ball with her forelegs, holds onto the ball using all of her legs, rolls the ball, detaches from and leaves the ball. The bee approaches a second ball, rolls it and detaches.",
