          "value": "The Hand-Release Push-Up (HRP) is the third event in the Army Combat Fitness Test. It develops endurance in the muscles of the shoulders, arms and trunk. The number of successfully completed repetitions is counted over a two minute period. Here is the breakdown of the event as it would be conducted during a test. #ACFT #ArmyFit",
